  "description": "**2 bed apartment available **\n\nLocated in U Citywest Quarter, this large 2-bedroom apartment features a well-designed and very well finished home. This beautiful home includes two large double bedrooms, two bathrooms, a large open-plan kitchen/dining-room and living area with access to private balcony.\n\nContemporary and comfortable, this bright airy apartment is tastefully furnished to a very high standard with bespoke U furniture by V2 Living throughout. Generous fitted wardrobes are provided in the bedroom. The apartments are all wired for TV, cable, satellite, and broadband services.\n\n*Not pet friendly. Photos for reference only*\n\n***Our team will endeavour to respond to all enquiries. However, this may not be possible in all cases due to the high volume of interest for the property and we wish you all the best with your property search.***",
